  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nt=int(input())\r\nfor i in range(t):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    a.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    p=[0]*(3*n+1)\r\n    for j in range(3*n):\r\n        p[j+1]=p[j]+a[j]\r\n    best=0\r\n    for x in range(n+1):\r\n        l=0\r\n        h=n-x\r\n        def value(y):\r\n            s=x\r\n            q=x+2*y\r\n            r=3*n-2*x-y\r\n            return 2*p[s]+p[q]+3*p[r]\r\n        while l<h:\r\n            m=(l+h)//2 \r\n            if value(m)<=value(m+1):\r\n                l=m+1\r\n            else:\r\n                h=m \r\n        best=max(best, value(l))\r\n    print(best)",
